---
---

<section
  class="relative isolate pb-2 pt-10 text-center sm:pt-14"
  aria-labelledby="hero-title"
>
  {/*
    Mancha Cinematic Aurora exclusiva do CineVee (SVG inline decorativo).
    Silhueta orgânica horizontal (lente/blob assimétrico, sem cantos),
    gradiente violeta → azul → ciano em baixa opacidade e blur SVG.
    A penumbra do blur + a base suave do path dissolvem as bordas, sem
    leitura de retângulo. Não captura ponteiro; ignorado por AT.
  */}
  <svg
    aria-hidden="true"
    focusable="false"
    viewBox="0 0 1600 520"
    preserveAspectRatio="none"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-[-12%] -z-10 h-[125%] w-[108vw] max-w-none -translate-x-1/2"
  >
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="cinevee-hero-aurora" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
        <stop offset="0" stop-color="#a78bfa" stop-opacity="0.55" />
        <stop offset="0.45" stop-color="#6366f1" stop-opacity="0.38" />
        <stop offset="0.75" stop-color="#38bdf8" stop-opacity="0.3" />
        <stop offset="1" stop-color="#22d3ee" stop-opacity="0.35" />
      </linearGradient>
      <filter
        id="cinevee-hero-blur"
        x="-40%"
        y="-40%"
        width="180%"
        height="180%"
      >
        <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="45" />
      </filter>
    </defs>
    <g opacity="0.55" filter="url(#cinevee-hero-blur)">
      <path
        fill="url(#cinevee-hero-aurora)"
        d="M 300 105
           C 600 80, 1000 80, 1300 105
           C 1420 115, 1465 170, 1468 260
           C 1465 350, 1420 405, 1300 415
           C 1000 440, 600 440, 300 415
           C 180 405, 135 350, 132 260
           C 135 170, 180 115, 300 105 Z"
      />
      <path
        fill="#38bdf8"
        fill-opacity="0.16"
        d="M 480 250
           C 560 180, 700 155, 860 150
           C 1030 145, 1170 175, 1230 255
           C 1170 335, 1030 365, 860 360
           C 700 355, 560 325, 480 250 Z"
      />
    </g>
  </svg>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary">
    Recomendação inteligente
  </p>
  <h1
    id="hero-title"
    class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-[20ch] text-balance text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight sm:text-5xl"
  >
    O que vamos assistir hoje?
  </h1>
  <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-pretty text-base text-base-content/70">
    Encontre filmes e séries que combinam com seu momento.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-6">
    <a
      href="/descobrir"
      class="btn btn-primary group h-12 min-h-12 w-full gap-2 rounded-full text-base font-semibold transition-transform duration-200 active:scale-[0.98] sm:w-auto sm:px-8"
    >
      <svg
        aria-hidden="true"
        width="18"
        height="18"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        class="transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:scale-110"
      >
        <path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M2 12h4M18 12h4M5 5l2.5 2.5M16.5 16.5 19 19M19 5l-2.5 2.5M7.5 16.5 5 19" />
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.2" />
      </svg>
      Descobrir para mim
    </a>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-base-content/60">
      Poucas perguntas. Recomendações feitas para você.
    </p>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>
